      "writtenOn": "2021-07-23T11:36:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s a runtime issue, hcd_priv_size will be changed in xhci_init_driver() according to extra_priv_size and hcd driver allocates the extra memory for it. If the xhci platform drivers don\u0027t define extra_priv_size, then it would cause a out-of-bound memory error.",
